    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This two bedroom single storey town house enjoys a very central location within a stroll of all amenities including, The Waterford Greenway, Abbeyside Beach & Boardwalk, Eurospar grocery Shop, and ten minutes walk from Dungarvan town centre with, Dungarvan Shopping Centre, Restaurants, Bars, Walton Park, and town walks, all literally on the doorstep. The deceptive accommodation needs some cosmetic upgrading and comprises of, Entrance Hallway, Sitting room, Kitchen/Dining area, two Bedrooms, and Bathroom. The property also has the benefit of a private enclosed rear garden ideal for those Summer months. This little Gem will ideally suit a first time buyer, retirement residence, holiday home or investment. \r\nBungalows seldom come to the market within walking distance of Dungarvan Town Centre and DNG Morrissey properties highly recommend viewing of this property. \r\nViewing Strictly by Appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: \r\n\r\nEntrance Porch: 6.0x1.0m (19' 8\" x 3' 3\") \r\nCeramic floor tiling and central lighting, providing a practical introduction to the home.\r\n\r\nLiving Room: 4.8m x 2.8m (15' 9\" x 9' 2\") \r\nA spacious living room featuring laminate flooring, a fireplace with ceramic tiled hearth and a Stanley solid-fuel stove. central lighting and TV point. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 4.1m x 3.3m (13' 5\" x 10' 10\")\r\nA well-appointed kitchen and dining area with a fitted kitchen, ceramic tiled flooring and central lighting. The room benefits from a skylight providing natural light and a door leading to the private rear garden. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.7m x 2.4m (15' 5\" x 7' 10\")\r\nSpacious double bedroom featuring laminate flooring, a skylight offering natural light, centre lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.0m x 2.3m (6' 7\" x 7' 7\")\r\nDouble bedroom features laminate flooring, centre lighting, hot press storage.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 3.0m x 1.8m (9' 10\" x 5' 11\") \r\nA generously sized family bathroom comprising of a, Wc, wash hand basin and corner shower unit, ceramic floor tiles, centre lighting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside:\r\n\r\n•\tFantastic residential location within Dungarvan town.\r\n•\tThe Waterford Greenway, 50 metres away.\r\n•\tDungarvan town centre 10 minutes walk away.\r\n•\tAbbeyside Beach 10 minutes walk away.\r\n•\tAbbeyside Church 10 minutes walk away.\r\n•\tPrivate rear garden.\r\n\t\t\r\nIncluded :\r\n\r\n•\tLight fittings.\r\n•\tFloor coverings.\r\n•\tFixtures and fittings.                                                                                           \r\n\r\nGeneral features;\r\n\r\n•\tOil fired central heating.\r\n•\tPVC double glazed windows.\r\n•\tPVC facia and soffit.\r\n•\tClose access to the N25 Waterford/Cork route.\r\n•\tCable TV and broadband.\r\n•\tExcellent location, walking distance of Dungarvan town, close to schools and all amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Dungarvan town centre proceed towards the Causeway and go straight through at the traffic lights, proceed past Apache Pizza and take the immediate turn right, follow the road around the bend to the left and see the property on the left side, see the DNG Morrissey Properties sign.\r\n\r\n___________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE.\r\n\r\nDNG Morrissey properties, for themselves and for the Vendors or Lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that; 1. The particulars contained herein are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or tenants, and do not constitute any part of any offer or contract and are not in any way legally binding. 2. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. 3. No person in the employment of DNG Morrissey Properties has the authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. 4. The particulars contained herein are confidential and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through DNG Morrissey Properties. 5. DNG Morrissey Properties disclaims all liability and responsibility for any direct and/or indirect loss or damage which may be suffered by any recipient through relying on any particular contained in or omitted from the aforementioned particulars.\r\n\r\n\r\n___________________________________________________________________________"
      }
